From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LLCOOLT <114613597+LLCOOLT@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 18:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] gx: AuroraGetResourceStats, what Aurora holds, for a growth guard

Paper Cut #39 (an Android handheld at 1 fps, then the device lost): the port
watches Aurora's resources each frame and stops growth that never ends.
AuroraGetResourceStats gives the last frame's render passes, texture copies,
readbacks and uploads (and those with a buffer of their own), the textures
alive and their estimated bytes (each TextureRef counted as it is made and
let go), the cached bind groups and samplers, the texture object, content
and EFB copy caches, and the offscreen and resolve_pass snapshot targets.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
